  "description": "A browser-based, turn-based multiplayer quiz game. Players take turns rolling a die and moving through a maze from the bottom-left corner to the top-right one. Landing on a flag opens a timed multiple-choice question: a correct answer earns points and extra steps, a wrong one ends the turn.",
